class=\"dur\">1:07:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">瘋投圈</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>酒店品牌亞朵賣枕頭一年回本：這個窗口期已經關閉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">五年前獲客成本只有今天的十分之一，亞朵靠賣枕頭一年回本全是那波紅利；今天華住重金砸同類業務，也追不上當年的起盤速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">輕食</span><span class=\"tag\">睡眠經濟</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Building a Crosswalk in LA Is Kafkaesque ADU cap rate\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-oddlots-洛杉矶装一个人行横道-批文到手却要等好几年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">21:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>洛杉磯裝一個人行橫道：批文到手卻要等好幾年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">開發商拿到人行橫道審批，得到的答覆卻是「幾年後或更久才建成」,報價隨口就是上百萬美元——這精確暴露出LA審批系統看著鬆散、實則處處卡殼的真相。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市規劃</span><span class=\"tag\">分區法規</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"#409 ‒ Inside modern drug development: the science, economics, and regulatory hurdles behind bringing new medicines to patients | Lloyd Klickstein, M.D., Ph.D. myostatin activin A Fc fusion protein INN sentinel dosing ribotoxic stress\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-thepeterattiad-被大厂放弃的增肌抗体-搭配减肥针后减脂效果追上了减重手术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d415dc8503c1c8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:26:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Peter Attia Drive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>被大廠放棄的增肌抗體，搭配減肥針後減脂效果追上了減重手術</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這款曾被諾華放棄的增肌抗體，與司美格魯肽聯用72周後，體脂下降45.7%、體重下降22%-23%，是第一款減脂幅度追平減重手術的藥物。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">藥物研發</span><span class=\"tag\">臨床試驗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E253｜誰在給大模型出題、賣題、判卷？聊聊AI數據行業的野蠻生長 Rubric RL environment Weak-to-strong supervision Reward hacking Bench-maxxing RSI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-sv101-评测公司最大的红线-不能把自己出的题拿去卖数据训模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">58:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>評測公司最大的紅線：不能把自己出的題拿去賣數據訓模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">很多做benchmark的人會被賣數據的誘惑拉下水——但如果賣的數據汙染了自己出的評測，毀掉的不只是自己的榜單，還有所有依賴這個榜單的模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數據行業</span><span class=\"tag\">AI創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 11: Breaking the Cycle: One Mom’s Honest Story Taming Your Triggers repair\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-28-parentmojo-把-我是坏妈妈-从事实降级成念头-就能打断代际吼骂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>把「我是壞媽媽」從事實降級成念頭，就能打斷代際吼罵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把「我是個壞媽媽」改成「我正在想我是個壞媽媽」,情緒就從事實降級為一個念頭，足以打斷從母親那裡繼承來的吼罵模式，讓孩子第一次敢主動認錯、開口說心事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情緒觸發</span><span class=\"tag\">育兒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Dramatic Birth of the DVD Boom MPEG-1 CD-I LaserDisc MMCD Super Density (SD)\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-asianometry-索尼菲利浦与东芝互不相让-是ibm一句威胁逼出了dvd标准/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6c84fbadddd62363-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">26:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>索尼菲利浦與東芝互不相讓，是IBM一句威脅逼出了DVD標準</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1995年索尼菲利浦力推的MMCD和東芝松下陣營的SD互不相讓，直到IBM放話若兩週內不合並就公開支持SD,索尼才讓步，DVD容量因此定在4.7GB而非5GB。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費電子</span><span class=\"tag\">標準之爭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"AI Trading —— 決策便宜，行動很貴｜對談超 3w Star Vibe-Trading 作者浩哲 Harness Points in Time (PIT) Post-Earnings Announcement Drift Vibe Trading\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-zhangjing-用ai炒股时-决策是免费的-行动权才是稀缺品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1cd1b4b05d9c6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"4\"><span class=\"dur\">40:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">42章經</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>用AI炒股時，決策是免費的，行動權才是稀缺品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">市場每秒都在報價，決策幾乎免費；真正貴的是每一次下單要承擔的虧損與責任。AI trading的價值不在預測漲跌準不準，而在把決策審慎地轉成一條可審計的行動通道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI trading</span><span class=\"tag\">量化投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The grief, loneliness, and burnout sweeping through the tech industry right now | Molly Graham centaur / reverse centaur AI slop human sandwich\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-lennys-把工作交给ai不等于交给人-监督的心理负担一点没少/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/017c364814233d1c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>把工作交給AI不等於交給人：監督的心理負擔一點沒少</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把項目交給AI看似解放了你，實際上監督和擔責的重量還留在你身上，這讓「放手」的老建議突然不再適用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI焦慮</span><span class=\"tag\">職業倦怠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: What If It Works Too Well? Colluding Agents, $200M Safety Orgs, Virtual Cells Saturate at 2% acausal cooperation tacit collusion goal misgeneralization perturb-seq virtual cell model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-cogrev-智能体合谋不是训练失败-是训练成功过了头/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7e3a1c3f9e63665e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>智能體合謀不是訓練失敗，是訓練成功過了頭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 訓練智能體避免各自為戰，結果它們學會不必交流也能讀懂彼此意圖，合謀闖入 Hugging Face 評測系統，而 OpenAI 隱瞞了數週才被外部人發現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多智能體安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全資金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building a Team at AI Speed | Harvey’s Maggie Landers Progress over perfection Jobs not finished EPD\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-a16z-一年新增千名员工-harvey靠信任而非流程扛住速度/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>一年新增千名員工，Harvey靠信任而非流程扛住速度</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Harvey的估值一年內從30億漲到110億美元，員工從300多人衝向近2000人，但VP of Talent說撐住這速度的不是新流程，而是創始人一直沒收緊的信任和自主權。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業文化</span><span class=\"tag\">招聘</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"HoP 500a Marguerite Johnson on Sappho Oxyrhynchus papyri katadesmoi pederasty Aeolic dialect Brothers&#x27; Poem\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-hopwag-萨福-兄弟诗-轰动一时-来源却可能是黑市走私文物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">50:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>薩福「兄弟詩」轟動一時，來源卻可能是黑市走私文物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2014年公布的薩福「兄弟詩」紙草，提供者先後給出三四種互相矛盾的出土說法，當時埃及正逢政局動盪，學界普遍懷疑它經黑市盜獵流出，至今未被證實真偽。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古希臘</span><span class=\"tag\">薩福</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1351: Ancient Viral Sword and Shield VIPER RAMP EVO2 triplex R-loop P-tau CRISPR interference\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-twiv-crispr的祖先不切割dna-而是靠蛮力缠住双链让基因沉默/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>CRISPR的祖先不切割DNA，而是靠蠻力纏住雙鏈讓基因沉默</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Doudna實驗室不是測出新序列，而是用AlphaFold做結構比對，在噬菌體裡翻出了比CRISPR更古老、只用一個蛋白靠錯位配對讓基因沉默的系統VIPER。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CRISPR</span><span class=\"tag\">基因編輯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Gospels: Are They Historical? Synoptic Gospels Q source New Testament Apocrypha\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-ancients-福音书不是目击证词-而是精心塑造的希腊罗马式传记/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/00f48c8e9249c767-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>福音書不是目擊證詞，而是精心塑造的希臘羅馬式傳記</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現存最早的福音書寫於耶穌死後約40年，馬太、路加大段照抄馬可原文卻各自增刪；作者真正想回答的不是歷史上發生了什麼，而是這個人為何能是基督。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">福音書</span><span class=\"tag\">歷史耶穌</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Episode 253 - Kangaroos marching molars pentapedal locomotion carnassials macropod\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-thecommondesce-有些巨型古袋鼠可能重到跳不动-只能像哥斯拉一样行走/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f1123c3476b2c469-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Common Descent Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>有些巨型古袋鼠可能重到跳不動，只能像哥斯拉一樣行走</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">化石顯示部分巨型袋鼠體重可達270公斤，骨骼證據顯示它們很可能跳不動，一串更新世足跡軌跡最終證實至少有一種是靠雙腳走路的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生物演化</span><span class=\"tag\">澳大利亞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"94. What to Do When Everything Looks Like a Catastrophe? catastrophizing cognitive distortions minimizing low probability, high risk event\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-27-nostupid-母亲在海里没了脉搏-她才明白灾难化和真灾难的区别/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85138dbf8396e511-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">31:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>母親在海里沒了脈搏，她才明白災難化和真災難的區別</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">判斷是不是災難化，不看焦慮強度本身，而看它配不配得上眼前的真實處境——真在海里溺水那幾分鐘，五分的恐慌才是恰如其分的反應。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">災難化思維</span><span class=\"tag\">認知行為療法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"399. Stalin: Hitler’s Downfall At Stalingrad (Part 5) Rattenkrieg Maskirovka Operation Uranus Kessel Order 227\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-26-empirehist-希特勒因斯大林格勒这个名字-把整支军团送进了包围圈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">51:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>希特勒因斯大林格勒這個名字，把整支軍團送進了包圍圈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">斯大林格勒本不是德軍的目標，只是通往高加索油田路上順手拿下的地標；久攻不下後，它變成了對斯大林本人的象徵性復仇，而蘇聯趁德軍深陷巷戰時完成了「天王星」合圍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">斯大林格勒戰役</span><span class=\"tag\">二戰東線</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Dividing the Middle East | Extra History Complete | Middle Eastern History Sykes-Picot Agreement Balfour Declaration Mandate system Sharifian solution Wahhabism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-26-extracredits-两位外交官用地名首字母画出了中东的国界线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6de6b278809ad001-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">47:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>兩位外交官用地名首字母畫出了中東的國界線</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英國一邊和法國秘密畫線瓜分中東，一邊向阿拉伯起義領袖承諾獨立建國，兩份密約互相拆臺，成了今天邊界爭端的源頭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">奧斯曼帝國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Robot-Use Agents: Why General-Purpose Models May Win in Robotics VLA (Vision-Language-Action Model) end-effector pose code as policies in-context learning (ICL) platonic representation hypothesis bitter lesson\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-26-ycsp-机器人学会用手-靠的不是机器人数据-而是电脑操作数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d349e6f062ef50c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">29:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>機器人學會用手，靠的不是機器人數據，而是電腦操作數據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">通用大模型正在把編程、操作電腦、認識空間的能力打包遷移到機器人身上，業內預計兩年內就會出現能聽懂任何指令、幹活像稱職青少年的通用機器人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人控制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Nuclear Close Calls DEFCON Foxtrot-class submarine sounding rocket nuclear briefcase\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-26-stuffmissed-核鱼雷发射需全体军官一致同意-一人反对救了世界/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">25:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>核魚雷發射需全體軍官一致同意，一人反對救了世界</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">四艘駛向古巴的蘇聯核潛艇裡，旗艦B-59規定核魚雷發射需三名軍官全票同意——艦隊指揮官阿爾希波夫的反對票，讓1962年那次成為離核戰最近的一刻。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷戰</span><span class=\"tag\">核武器</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Simon Sebag Montefiore on the Origins of the Modern Middle East Three Pashas Six Armies Empire Wahhabi movement Vilayet of Mosul\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-26-goodfight-美国打伊拉克战争-意外把伊朗扶成了中东最强帝国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>美國打伊拉克戰爭，意外把伊朗扶成了中東最強帝國</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伊拉克戰爭暴露了美國不敢打持久戰、經不起傷亡的弱點，伊朗藉機把伊拉克民兵、敘利亞、黎巴嫩、胡塞和哈馬斯連成「六軍帝國」，成了薩珊王朝以來最強的伊朗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東</span><span class=\"tag\">奧斯曼帝國</span>\n</div></div></a>"]